{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to all who dare to embark on the adventure toward OLYMPUSAN!A journey to the summit awaits you. It will be an exciting adventure, but don't expect a comfortable ride. And beware\u2014this place is far from friendly. Watch out for those who lurk in the shadows, waiting for you...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550900/extras/ce898d16269e30c80bc8d1f1bff8a987.avif?t=1743168945\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550900/extras_big/ce898d16269e30c80bc8d1f1bff8a987.avif?t=1743168945 width=800 height=396 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game features three mountains. With five hearts, can you conquer all three summits? Various monsters will stand in your way\u2014defeat them! When you face a crossroads, choose your path wisely. Use teleportation to travel faster, and collect hidden points worldwide. This journey will awaken your spirit of challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550900/extras/ebbf9026818ff1c69b21a65441a98d8d.avif?t=1743168945\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550900/extras_big/ebbf9026818ff1c69b21a65441a98d8d.avif?t=1743168945 width=800 height=382 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat your enemies! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect points! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid the traps! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve the puzzle! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb to the top!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550900/extras/b6740a71e46389f0c6e9ade5984ad2e8.avif?t=1743168945\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550900/extras_big/b6740a71e46389f0c6e9ade5984ad2e8.avif?t=1743168945 width=800 height=390 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, if you're ready to begin the adventure, brace yourself. Stay calm, be persistent, and push forward toward your goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The journey toward OLYMPUSAN has only just begun. The road will be long, and many more episodes await you.\u00a0Enjoy a 2D adventure platformer game!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3550900?t=1743168945","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3550900?t=1743168945","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550900/9aada58b68320711147bb40a67800cab274b9e75/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743168945","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550900/9aada58b68320711147bb40a67800cab274b9e75/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743168945","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to all who dare to embark on the adventure toward OLYMPUSAN!A journey to the summit awaits you. It will be an exciting adventure, but don't expect a comfortable ride. And beware\u2014this place is far from friendly. Watch out for those who lurk in the shadows, waiting for you...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550900/extras/ce898d16269e30c80bc8d1f1bff8a987.avif?t=1743168945\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550900/extras_big/ce898d16269e30c80bc8d1f1bff8a987.avif?t=1743168945 width=800 height=396 /></span><